ing":"async","loading":"lazy","width":400,"height":268,"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7a/Hazelnut_chocolate_truffles%2C_saffron_poached_pear_with_lime_yoghurt%2C_grapefruit_jelly_and_sahleb_-_Gigibaba_AUD8_per_person.jpg/960px-Hazelnut_chocolate_truffles%2C_saffron_poached_pear_with_lime_yoghurt%2C_grapefruit_jelly_and_sahleb_-_Gigibaba_AUD8_per_person.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail 2x"},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/Hazelnut_chocolate_truffles%2C_saffron_poached_pear_with_lime_yoghurt%2C_grapefruit_jelly_and_sahleb_-_Gigibaba_AUD8_per_person.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hazelnut_chocolate_truffles,_saffron_poached_pear_with_lime_yoghurt,_grapefruit_jelly_and_sahleb_-_Gigibaba_AUD8_per_person.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:Redirect/page/11868290","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2010-10-24 08:36:00","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Hazelnut chocolate truffles, saffron poached pear with lime yoghurt, grapefruit jelly and sahleb - Gigibaba AUD8 per person","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Taken with Nikon D60|Chocolate truffles|Saffron|Salep|Flickr images uploaded by Flickr upload bot|Hazelnuts as food|Yogurt as a sauce|Photographs by Avlxyz|Poached pears|Grapefruit as food","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<p>The saffron poached pear was perfectly paired with a lime yoghurt. While the hazelnut chocolate truffles were a bit rich and sweet, they were nice with a Turkish coffee, though that was a bit weak.\n</p>\nThe most intriguing dessert was the grapefruit jelly with sahleb. I think she said &lt;a href=\"<a class=\"external free\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salep\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salep\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Salep</a>\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;salep&lt;/a&gt;. The starchy salep was studded with nuts and topped with a tangy and slightly bitter grapefruit jelly. It was soon but an empty cup!","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2009-05-30 19:20:01","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"originally posted to <b><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Flickr\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flickr\">Flickr</a></b> as <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://flickr.com/photos/10559879@N00/3578605010\">Hazelnut chocolate truffles, saffron poached pear with lime yoghurt, grapefruit jelly and sahleb - Gigibaba AUD8 per person</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://flickr.com/people/10559879@N00\">Alpha</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Permission":{"value":"<table id=\"FlickrReview\" style=\"width:100%; margin:0.3em auto; text-align:start; background-color:var(--background-color-success-subtle,#d5fdf4); padding: 3px; border:1px solid var(--border-color-base,#a2a9b1); color:inherit;\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Checked_copyright_icon.svg/60px-Checked_copyright_icon.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"48\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Checked_copyright_icon.svg/120px-Checked_copyright_icon.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"153\"></span></span>\n</td>\n<td>This image, which was o